WEBVTT

00:00:00.058 --> 00:00:03.355
Draw a component diagram and trace one successful and one

00:00:03.390 --> 00:00:04.156
failed workflow.

00:00:04.760 --> 00:00:07.906
Identify the source of truth, an access boundary, and at

00:00:07.976 --> 00:00:09.659
least one recovery concern.

00:00:10.263 --> 00:00:14.501
Write a build specification with scope, non-goals, input

00:00:14.547 --> 00:00:18.867
validation, expected outputs, state changes, errors,

00:00:19.041 --> 00:00:23.255
security, preservation requirements, acceptance checks,

00:00:23.499 --> 00:00:24.347
and rollback.

00:00:24.950 --> 00:00:27.853
Translate broad claims into observable behaviors.

00:00:28.236 --> 00:00:30.964
If the owner says the tracker must never send an automatic

00:00:31.022 --> 00:00:33.786
email, the spec must preserve that boundary.
